text_translations.en:
• Vehicles on public transport line no. 17,  će u smeru ka Zemunu saobraćati ulicama: Bulevar Zorana Đinđića, Bulevar umetnosti,  Bulevar Mihajla Pupina i dalje redovno, dok će u smeru ka Konjarniku saobraćati Bulevar Mihajla Pupina, Španskih boraca, Bulevar Zorana Đinđića i dalje redovno;
• Vehicles on public transport line no. 68, in the direction of Zeleni venc, will run through the following streets: Omladinskih brigade, Mihajlo Pupin Boulevard, Spanskih boraca, Zoran Đinđić Boulevard, while in the direction of New Belgrade, Zorana Đinđić Boulevard, Art Boulevard, Mihajlo Pupin Boulevard, Youth Brigade will continue to run regularly;
• Vehicles on public transport line no. 71, in the direction of Ledine, will operate on the following streets: Boulevard Mihajlo Pupin, Omladinskih brigada, Boulevard Milutin Milankovića, while in the direction of Zeleni venc, it will operate on the streets, Boulevard of Arts, Boulevard of Zoran Djindjic, Spanish Fighters, Boulevard Mihajlo Pupina;
• Vehicles on public transport line no. 74 in the direction of Mirijevo will operate on the following streets: Bulevar Zorana Đinđić, Youth Brigade, Bulevar Mihajlo Pupin, Spanskih Borac, while in the direction of Bežanijska Kosa, it will operate on Bulevar Zorana Đinđić, Boulevard of the Arts, Bulevar Mihajlo Pupin, Bulevar Mihajlo Pupin, Bulevar Zorana Đinđić, and in both directions in accordance with the works on the street Nedeljko Gvozdenovića;
• Vehicles on public transport line no. 75 i  ADA 5 će u smeru ka Zelenom vencu, Trgu republike i Adi Ciganliji saobraćati ulicama: Bulevar Zorana Đinđića, Omladinskih brigada, Bulevar Mihajla Pupina, Španskih boraca, Bulevar Zorana Đinđića i dalje redovno dok će u smeru ka Bežanijskoj kosi saobraćati, Bulevar Zorana Đinđića, Bulevar umetnosti, Bulevar Mihajla Pupina, Omladinskih brigade, Bulevar Zorana Đinđić still regularly and in both directions in accordance with the works in Nedeljka Gvozdenovića Street;
•

sections.text:
• vozila sa linija br. 70, 74, 75 i ADA 5 će saobraćati do privremenog  dolazno/polaznog stajališta „Bežanijska kosa 1“, u ulici Srđana Aleksića na poziciji ED stuba koji se nalazi oko 50 metara posle pešačkog prelaza u zoni raskrsnice ulica Srđana Aleksića i Nedeljka Gvozdenovića. U smeru ka gradu vozila će dalje saobraćati ulicama Srđana Aleksića, Vespučijeva, Magelanova, Nedeljka Gvozdenovića i  dalje redovnim trasama;
• vozila sa linije br. 72 će u oba smera saobraćati ulicama Tošin bunar, Vojvođanska, Surčinska i dalje redovnom trasom;
• vozila sa linije br. 72N  će u oba smera saobraćati ulicama Bulevar Zorana Đinđića, Žorža Matea, Partizanske avijacije, Marka Čelebonovića, Dr Huga Klajna, Ljubinke Bobić, Gandijeva, Vojvođanska, Surčinska i dalje redovnom trasom.

text_translations.en:
• vehicles from lines no. 70, 74, 75 and ADA 5 will run to the temporary arrival/departure stop "Bežanijska kosa 1", in Srđana Aleksića street, at the position of the ED pillar, which is located about 50 meters after the pedestrian crossing in the area of ​​the intersection of Srđana Aleksića and Nedeljko Gvozdenovića streets. In the direction of the city, vehicles will continue to travel on the streets of Srđan Aleksić, Vespuccijev, Magelanov, Nedeljko Gvozdenović and on regular routes;
• vehicles from line no. 72 will run in both directions on the streets Tošin bunar, Vojvođanska, Surčinska and further along the regular route;
• vehicles from line no. 72N will run in both directions on Bulevar Zoran Đinđić, Žorž Mateo, Partizanska avijacija, Marko Čelebonović, Dr. Hugo Klajn, Ljubinka Bobić, Gandijeva, Vojvođanska, Surčinska streets and further along the regular route.

